\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{n+nt}{\PYGZdq{}reasoning\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{:}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}此前尝试已确认 2015 年展览为 \PYGZsq{}Celebrating the Year of the Ram\PYGZsq{}，}
